@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = replace-with-bearer-token
@productId = replace-with-product-uuid

### Products: paginated active list
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products: case-insensitive name substring and unit intersection
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?name=%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE&unit=liter&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products: exact SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?sku=MILK-001&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products: no matches returns 200 and []
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?sku=SKU-THAT-DOES-NOT-EXIST
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products: unknown unit returns 400 JSON error
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?unit=unknown
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products: invalid pagination returns 400 JSON error
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?page=0&limit=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product: invalid UUID returns 400 JSON error
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product update: invalid UUID returns 400 JSON error
PUT {{baseUrl}}/product/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milk",
  "sku": "MILK-001",
  "unit": "liter"
}

### Product archive: invalid UUID returns 400 JSON error
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product/not-a-uuid/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product: valid UUID owned by another company returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
